<div style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; width: 960px;"><br />
<span style="font-family:Poppins, sans-serif"><span style="float:right">Policy Number:&nbsp;{{{Case.Insurance_Policy_Number__c}}}</span>{{{Recipient.Name}}}<br />
{{{Recipient.Address__c}}}</span><br />
<br />
<br />
&nbsp;</div>

<div style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; width: 960px; text-align: right;"><b>Date:&nbsp;{{{Case.Today_s_Date__c}}}</b></div>

<p><br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
<span style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(2, 78, 255);"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><b>We are still reviewing your complaint.</b></span></span><br />
<br />
<br />
<font face="Poppins, sans-serif">Hello&nbsp; {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</font><br />
<br />
<b style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;">Complaint Reference:&nbsp;</b><font face="Poppins, sans-serif"> {{{Case.CaseNumber}}}</font><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">Thank you for your recent <strong>Email/Phone call/Letter/webchat</strong> &lt;-- &lt;Pick correct option&gt;</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">I am sorry you have been unhappy with our service recently. I would like to reassure you that we take all concerns seriously, so are treating this as a complaint.<br />
<br />
I would like to reassure you that whilst the Financial Conduct Authority asks us to reply to complaints within 8 weeks, we aim to provide you with a full response much sooner.<br />
<br />
We will provide an update on progress within four weeks of this letter.<br />
<br />
If you require any further assistance in the meantime you are still welcome to contact us on <b>0203 808 7099</b>, or e-mail us at&nbsp;</span><span style="color:black"><a href="mailto:complaints@toolboxbyadmiral.com" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline">complaints@toolboxbyadmiral.com</a> </span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">I’d like to take the opportunity to provide a copy of our guide to handling your complaint at the bottom of this page.<br />
<br />
Thank you for your patience while we review the matter.</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">Yours sincerely</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span style="color:#252525">(Your name) (Your title Department</span></b><b><span style="color:black">)</span></b><b>&nbsp;</b></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
<b style="color: rgb(2, 78, 255); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 24px;">Our Guide to Handling your Complaint </b><font color="#024eff" face="Poppins, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><b>because</b></span></font><b style="color: rgb(2, 78, 255); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 24px;">&nbsp;you matter to us.</b><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">At Toolbox by Admiral, we are committed to providing the best possible service. However, we understand there may be times when we do not meet your expectations. We want all our customers to let us know straight away if they are unhappy. We believe handling complaints is an invaluable learning tool.</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">If you need to make a complaint</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">We aim to resolve your complaint quickly and efficiently. We want to: • Make it easy for you to tell us about your complaint • Carry out a full investigation • Give your complaint our careful attention • Provide a thorough account of our actions • Make sure you are happy we have handled your complaint fairly.</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<u><strong><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">How to make a complaint</span></span></span></span></strong></u><br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">We understand that making a complaint can be stressful in itself. That’s why we want you to be able to complain in any way you choose.</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">Tel: <b>0203 808 7099</b> Email:&nbsp;</span><span style="color:black"><a href="mailto:complaints@toolboxbyadmiral.com" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline">complaints@toolboxbyadmiral.com</a> </span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">Write: Toolbox Customer Services Manager, Ty Admiral, David Street, Cardiff CF10 2AA Fax: 0333 222 5770 Tel: 0330 333 5888.<br />
<br />
Whichever method you choose, a member of staff fully trained in complaint handling will deal with your complaint.</span></span><br />
<br />
<u><strong><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">How soon will we deal with your complaint?</span></span></span></strong></u><br />
<span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">We will contact you initially within five working days of receiving your complaint. We will either respond with a full reply or send you an acknowledgement letter, which will tell you:</span></span></span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">Who is dealing with your complaint </span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">When we will contact you again</span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">Once we have sent you an acknowledgement letter we will investigate your complaint fully and write to you with our findings. If your complaint is particularly complex, we may need to spend longer investigating it. In these cases, we will keep you up to date on our progress. In all cases we will respond to your complaint within 8 weeks, in line with the deadline set by the Financial Conduct Authority.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">If you are unhappy with the way we are handling your complaint. All our complaint handlers are trained and monitored on their complaint handling skills. If at any time, you are unhappy with the way we are handling your complaint, you can ask to have it reviewed at a higher level.</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">The Financial Ombudsman Service<br />
<br />
We try to resolve all complaints internally. However, if you remain unhappy with our response to your complaint, or if we have not resolved it 8 weeks after you first told us about it, you have the right to refer your complaint to the Financial Ombudsman Service. If you want the Financial Ombudsman Service to look into your complaint, you must refer it to them within 6 months of the date of our final response to you. You can contact them at:</span></span></span></span>

<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">The Financial Ombudsman Service Exchange Tower London E14 9SR</span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">Tel: 08000 234 567</span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">Or: 0300 123 9123</span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">Email:&nbsp;</span><span style="color:black"><a href="mailto:complaint.info@financial-ombudsman.org.uk" title="mailto:complaint.info@financial-ombudsman.org.uk"><span style="color:#fe46a5">complaint.info@financial-ombudsman.org.uk</span></a></span></span></span></span><br />
	&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:#252525">The Financial Ombudsman Service offers a free independent service and they can help with most financial complaints. For further information you can visit their website at&nbsp;</span><span style="color:black"><a href="https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.financial-ombudsman.org.uk%2F&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cvictoria.squibbs%40veygo.com%7Cd51a769c88f34a53026108dbe9a81892%7C5803c697e750498e86be1ee68154cf3f%7C0%7C0%7C638360680402487856%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=%2FX4kSKHfQaOMCf3Y0NlNodvlPFYuSmoDWuq0hj%2B5H6U%3D&amp;reserved=0" title="https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.financial-ombudsman.org.uk%2F&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cvictoria.squibbs%40veygo.com%7Cd51a769c88f34a53026108dbe9a81892%7C5803c697e750498e86be1ee68154cf3f%7C0%7C0%7C638360680402487856%7CUnknown%7CT"><span style="color:#0563c1">www.financial-ombudsman.org.uk</span></a></span><span style="color:#252525">.</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
